3|// Herdr's socket API, for the writes the CLI wrapper makes too slow.
4|//
5|// Every `herdr` CLI call is a process spawn — 40-80ms on Windows — and the
6|// animator writes tokens per pane, so a mode flip that repaints thirty panes
7|// crawled through seconds of serial spawns while the sidebar visibly walked
8|// into place. The socket takes the same requests as newline-delimited JSON;
9|// the server answers one request per connection and hangs up, so calls are
10|// parallel by construction. A small in-flight cap keeps a full repaint from
11|// opening seventy pipes at once.
12|
13|const net = require('node:net');
14|const path = require('node:path');
